==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Diglett}}.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} Alolan {{p|Diglett}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM-P Promo|Alolan Diglett|163}}, one of the {{TCG|SM-P Promotional cards}} released only in Japan.
*{{m|Headbutt}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Alolan Diglett can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

